% expect-output: 0
% expect-output: 1
% expect-output: 2
% expect-output: 2
% Scenario: Identity is predefined. The Identity-H and Identity-V CMaps
% are resources held outside VM (status 2) and loaded on first use by
% running the shipped CMap program through the CIDInit operators; their
% writing modes are 0 and 1, and Identity-V chains to Identity-H through
% usecmap.
% Expect: 0, 1, 2, 2.
/Identity-H /CMap findresource /WMode get =
/Identity-V /CMap findresource /WMode get =
/Identity-H /CMap resourcestatus pop pop =
/Identity-V /CMap resourcestatus pop pop =
